msgid "The tool protects Sphinx roles, links, substitutions, numbers, and placeholders; applies multiword terminology from the technical translation guide; rate-limits requests for the Azure F0 tier; and rejects entries that fail structural checks. Details of rejected entries are written to ``_build/azure-translation-report.json``."
